---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

/**
 * Every claim on this page is a claim about how the site is built, so it has to
 * stay true as the site changes. All of it survives the move to static hosting:
 * no cookies, no analytics, no third-party embeds, no form — the site is files.
 *
 * The last paragraph is a commitment, not a description. If analytics, a form or
 * an embedded service is ever added, this page changes FIRST.
 */
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What this website collects, which is nothing, and what happens to an email you send."
>
  <section class="wrap measure">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <p>
      This website sets no cookies, runs no analytics or tracking, embeds nothing from third
      parties, and has no contact form. Visiting it does not create a record we can identify
      you by.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you email us, we hold your message and your address for the purpose of replying and
      for our own records. We do not use it for anything else, we do not share or sell it,
      and we do not add you to any mailing list.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may ask what personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask
      us to delete it, by writing to
      {" "}<a href="mailto:info@apia.org.au">info@apia.org.au</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is hosted by a third-party provider, whose servers keep standard access logs
      including IP addresses. Those logs are held by the host under its own terms and are not
      used by APIA.
    </p>
    <p>
      If this site ever adds analytics, a form, or an embedded service, this page will be
      updated before that happens.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
